        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "Let $U_1=\\N\\setminus\\{1\\}$. Among all proper numerical semigroups,\n\\[\n \\Phi(S)=U_1\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n S=O_m:=\\{0\\}\\cup\\{n\\in\\N:n\\geq m\\}\\quad\\text{for some }m\\geq2.\n\\]\nEvery $O_m$ is almost symmetric. Hence $U_1$ has an infinite fiber, with\nexactly one source of each positive Frobenius number.",
