        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "For $F\\geq1$, let $\\AS_F$ be the almost symmetric numerical semigroups\nof Frobenius number $F$, $\\mathcal S_F=\\Phi(\\AS_F)$, and\n$\\mathcal{NS}_F$ the semigroups in $\\mathcal S_F$, as in\n\\cite[Section~5, pp.~8--9]{DSY}. Then\n\\[\n 1\\leq|\\mathcal{NS}_F|\\leq|\\mathcal S_F|\n \\leq 2^{\\lfloor(F+1)/2\\rfloor-1}.\n\\]\nEvery output has Frobenius number $2(F-g(S)+1)-1\\leq F$.",
